 In highly secular cultures, patients often expect physicians to leave personal religious or atheistic values out of the consul- tation completely. But whether this distance between physician and patient is advantageous is not clear. It has even been argued that a match of concordant values, including religious or spiritual orientation in the physician–patient relationship, could improve the quality of treatment (Peteet 2014). A note must be made on why our focus in this viewpoint is mainly on religious values and not atheistic ones, as these secular values of physicians are equally important potential inﬂuencers on clinical practice, for good and for worse. Over the last 500 hundred years, modern evidence-based medicine has largely parted ways from its philosophical and relig\n\n当前量化状态：\n[medical] [锚定] severity=0.00, rescue_available=0.40, acuity=0.00\n[preference] dnr=0.00, attitude_refuse=0.50, clarity=0.45, capacity=0.53, info_completeness=0.55\n[qol] burden=0.00, net_effect=0.10\n[context] [锚定] resource_pressure=0.45, insurance_stress=0.00, family_conflict=0.00, religious_barrier=0.50, legal_constraint=0.00\n\n约束: nonmaleficence_floor(L3) ge0.20; autonomy_floor(L3) ge0.15; beneficence_floor(L3) ge0.15; justice_floor(L3) ge0.20; resource_hard(L1) le0.60\n\n协商轮次：2\n\n历史：\n[轮1] physician: 基于给出的信息和约束条件，患者的当前状态（severity=0.00, rescue_available=0.40, acuity=0.00）和质量生活（burden=0.00, net_effect=0.10）表明患者处于较稳定的状态。考\n[轮1] ethics_committee: 考虑到患者的态度拒绝（0.50）和信息完整性（0.55），我们需要优先考虑患者的自主权和不伤害原则。同时，考虑到医疗资源的压力（0.45）和宗教障碍（0.50），我们需要平衡治疗强度和资源可行性。\n[轮1] patient: 基于患者的当前状态和约束条件，治疗强度应在中等水平（L2），以确保患者的自主权（autonomy）得到尊重，同时避免对患者造成过多的伤害（nonmaleficence）。\n[轮1] family: 考虑到患者的自主权和不伤害原则，治疗方案应优先考虑患者的需求和偏好。同时，资源压力和保险压力较低，因此可以考虑提供相对较高水平的治疗。然而，宗教障碍和法律约束需要谨慎处理。\n[轮1] hospital_admin: 考虑到当前的资源压力（resource_pressure=0.45）和宗教障碍（religious_barrier=0.50），我们需要在医疗需求和资源可行性之间取得平衡。同时，需要确保患者的自主权（autonomy）和不伤害原则（nonm\n[轮1] catfish: 当前共识中非伤害原则和正义原则被低估，讨论还没有深入到足够的程度。我们需要更加细致地考虑医疗决策的伦理影响，并确保所有相关方的价值观和信仰得到尊重和保护。\n\n当前集体原则向量: 行善B=0.37, 不伤害N=0.28, 自主A=0.20, 公正J=0.15\n最被忽视的原则: 公正J=0.15（你的异议应优先针对它，除非你认为集体共识本身存在其它盲点）\n\n作为鲶鱼异议者：请审视上述共识，找出被沉默压制的角度。如果集体向量已平衡但讨论肤浅（如只重复医学事实未触及伦理张力），指出这一点。<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=2048, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: None, lora_request: None, prompt_adapter_request: None.
